G-LM-TELEMETRY (LM-B2) — the telemetry flywheel: every recall DECISION logged as a structured,
class-REDACTED telemetry-okf record. The data to tune/finetune/detect-drift. (2026-07-03)
=========================================================================================
Second brick of ADR-005 (CONTRACT-LIVING-MEMORY LM-B2). The engine now records what the memory
system DECIDED each turn — off the token path, privacy-first.

BUILD (engine this-commit, gated SP_TELEMETRY=1 + SP_TELEMETRY_LOG=<path>, default-off null floor):
  * routes.rs telem_emit_recall(query, entry, class, cos, margin, delivery, decision): appends one
    JSONL record at the recall DECISION point. Called at all three terminal branches — decline
    (attr-gate zero-inference), margin-skip, deliver. REDACTION (ADR-005 §3b): when the fired
    entry's class == private-secret, the query is replaced by a hash (#<hash>) and redacted:true —
    telemetry can NEVER carry a value the delivery path would have declined.
  * telemetry_report.py: the tuning/drift view — per-class/decision/delivery counts, cos-by-decision,
    margin stats, redaction check.
  * The engine logs the DECISION + (follow-on) timings; the harness joins OUTPUT + outcome by turn
    (it already has both) — one stream, two sides (ADR-005 §3).

GATE G-LM-TELEMETRY — served the mixed classify corpus (2 private-secrets, 1 counterfact, 1
persona) with SP_TELEMETRY=1; ran the query set. 6 structured records produced:
  by class:    private-secret 4 · counterfact 1 · persona 1
  by decision: deliver 4 · decline 2
  by delivery: recite 2 · attr-gate-strict 2 · systemecho 1 · system 1
  cos[deliver] mean 0.985 (0.950–1.000) · cos[decline] mean 0.932 · margin mean 0.049
  redacted records: 4/4 private-secret (query = hash)
  REDACTION CHECK: secret "K9X-4M2-8QP" appears in the log 0 times -> PASS.
Each private-secret query is a hash (#3259e7fd…, #0554cbe8…); counterfact/persona queries are in
the clear. Every decision — which entry, class, cos, margin, delivery mode, deliver/decline — is
now queryable data.

VERDICT: GREEN (engine decision-telemetry core). The flywheel produces a structured, class-
redacted per-decision stream: the raw material to (1) tune τ/margin/class-defaults from real
distributions, (2) build a finetune set (query→delivery/class), (3) detect drift over time.
Privacy-before-data proven (0 secret hits). Default-off = byte-identical.

SPEED: one JSONL append at the decision point, off the token path. Sub-ms. No forward added.

FOLLOW-ONS (CONTRACT LM-B2 remainder): add per-turn timings (prefill_s/decode_s/tok_s) + the OUTPUT
join (engine emits a `telemetry` SSE event on events_tx; harness StreamProcessor sinks it with the
answer + obey/leak outcome); mint a PoUW SpinorReceipt per record (addr = join key). Then LM-B3.

REPRO: run_classify.bat gate (SP_TELEMETRY=1); classify_run.py gate; python telemetry_report.py
_classify_corpus/telemetry.jsonl K9X-4M2-8QP. ENV: engine this-commit; RTX 2060 12GB.
